    <string name="rate_info_content">Today\'s completion rate:\nNumber of habits you should do today AND have completed ÷ number of habits you should do today (based on each habit\'s frequency).

All-time completion rate:\nAcross every habit from its creation date to today, the number of days you actually completed ÷ the number of days you were supposed to (per each habit\'s frequency).

Current streak:\nConsecutive days (ending today, or yesterday if you haven\'t checked in today) on which you completed at least one habit.

Best streak:\nThe longest run of consecutive days in history with at least one completion.

Weekly bars:\nEach of the last 7 days shows its own completion rate (done that day ÷ should-do that day).</string>

